SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 11:34:39 and reappears at 12:42:25 CEST\, s
 een from Vienna\, AT.\nThe Moon is 9° up in the SE · daylight\, Sun +42
 °.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view a
 t the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.2085&l
 on=16.3721
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.2085&lon=16.3721
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
